umber":129.0,"title":"Episode 129","overview":"5 of Shilake's 7 Monster fight with Flender & Zhai Quji. Spirit hall ready with plan and starts with Seven Treasure Glazed Tile Clan.","air_date":"2020-11-07","still":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1KJI7VHM2ZUOg5UHniz039mYhYQ.jpg","runtime":20},{"number":130.0,"title":"Episode 130","overview":"Wu Hun Dian (Spirit Hall Palace) had commenced thier plan, Seven Treasure Glazed Tile Clan is invaded, Ning Feng Zhi comes to Shrek acedemy to info Grandmaster about attack and alert Blue Lightning Tyrant Dragon Clan, but it's too late. Tang San reaches Xingdou (Stardou) and anticpate his meet with Xiao Wu","air_date":"2020-11-14","still":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s9MFgANyzzYjgUCMeHx749XSiBe.jpg","runtime":20},{"number":131.0,"title":"Episode 131","overview":"Tang San finds Spirit Hall members in XingDou (Star Dou) Forest, comes up plan to get in touch with them as Tang Yin resulting into conflict, Hu Liena joins them tries to mediate.","air_date":"2020-11-21","still":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tjr3Z0m9G9vpYE30QE6V0DQrAbH.jpg","runtime":20},{"number":132.0,"title":"Episode 132","overview":"Tang San successfully mingle with Spirit Hall people, to prevent capture of Xiao Wu. On the other hand Tian Dou empire's Emperor discusses with Da Shi (Grand Master) & Ning Fengzhi how to prevent Spirit Hall's domination & avenge their grievances.","air_date":"2020-11-28","still":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cLaToHCKdLb5NBnChS6XmGWD2kk.jpg","runtime":20},{"number":133.0,"title":"Episode 133","overview":"Spirit Hall people reach center of XingDou (Start Dou) Forest faces Er Ming & Xiao Wu and fight begans, later Da Ming also joins the fight against Ghost & Chrysanthemum Douluo. When rest people tries to catch Xiao Wu Tang intervenes & flee with Xiao Wu. Spirit Hall people pursing Tang San & Xiao Wu. When Tang San & Xiao Wu about to get away successfully, they are intercepted by Human faced spider of 30,000 years of cultivation & later caught up by Spirit Hall people.","air_date":"2020-12-05","still":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7poIHi6uAd1IOaFIlbcGoVbUpbD.jpg","runtime":20},{"number":134.0,"title":"Episode 134","overview":"After being caught up by Spirit Hall remaining people; to save Xiao Wu, Tang San paralyzes her by hitting her acupoints and fights with them. As he realises, he won't be able to both of them, he plans to sacifice himself to let Xiao Wu go, he intentionally destorys this right to give his right leg sprit bone which has flying ability to Xiao Wu. While Xiao Wu sees Tang San being bombarded with attacks, she ignites 1,00,000 years spirit ability to sacrifice herself. As Tang San isn't strong enough to handle 1,00,000 years spirit ring, she also melds are soul with her ring to stabilise her spirit ring with Tang San. during which even though Tang San has lost his consciousness but his soul sees and tries but unable to stop Xiao Wu.","air_date":"2020-12-12","still":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s0fl8D29ye4bH3lhYb3zBtaL1oW.jpg","runtime":20},{"number":135.0,"title":"Episode 135","overview":"Tang San wakes up to find a Soft Bone Demon Rabbit near by comes to realise it's Xiao Wu long side Yearning Heartbroken Red (flower). He knows Yearning Heartbroken Red has life saving uses it on Rabbit (Xiao Wu). After waiting for 10 days Tang San realises Rabbit (Xiao Wu) isn't Recognising him. Er'Ming (Titan Giant Ape) tells Rabbit is just body of Xiao Wu and lost her 1,00,000 years of cultivation and soul as she had used extreme method of sacrifice to save him. Er'Ming after having discussion with Da'Ming (Azure Sky Bull Python) tells Tang San that to save Xiao Wu, he must fulfil 3 conditions, first of which is to collect 3 medicine plants.\n\n1. 10,000 year old Sacred Soul Grass to awaken her soul\n\n2. 10,000 year Ginseng King Grade 9 to reshape her human form\n\n3. Neidan from Ancient Spirit Beast to unite her soul and body","air_date":"2020-12-19","still":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/21st3ipXhvkgQjrH7Fl2QeevjXM.jpg","runtime":20},{"number":136.0,"title":"Episode 136","overview":"After absorping 30,000 years Man Faced Demon spider Tang San's 8 Lance spider exteranl spirit bone is not only evolved but forms unique condition where in his 4 spirit bone\n\n50,000 years head bone\n\n8 Lance spider exteranl spirit bone\n\n100,000 years right arm bone\n\n100,000 years right leg bone\n\nfuses and form external armor and comes into conflict with eachother, which he's unable to comprend decides to confirm it with his teacher, Da Shi (Grand Master). Coming to Tian Dou city he meets with Dugu Bo, Poison Douluo after coming in clash with 4th Prince Xue Beng. Dugu Bo tells him to consider other perspective, as things may not seem as they are.","air_date":"2020-12-26","still":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sQ7dasgslxX85YpseCiBqbAz3WE.jpg","runtime":20},{"number":137.0,"title":"Episode 137","overview":"After having discussion with Dugu Bo, Tang San return to Shrek Academy to meet with his teacher. Tang San informs his teacher (Yu Xiaogang), teacher's wife (Liu Er'long) & Dean (Flender) of his happening. Realising his predicament Tang San find establishing \"Tang Sect\" as feasibile solution to fight againt Spirit Hall, he discusses it with Ma Hongjun and asks Ning Rongrong to invite Ning Fengzhi. while moving Tang San finds he's being tailed and comes up with guess by picking up couple things like other person's voice.","air_date":"2021-01-02","still":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tdXiwSSiDMjku9D3IjSUsyrxRfZ.jpg","runtime":20},{"number":138.0,"title":"Episode 138","overview":"Tang San and Ao Sika (Oscar) recognise eachother during the fight, after that they share their last 5 years experience with eachother. Tang San discuss with Grandmaster about armor he came across while upgrade of 8 Lance spider external spirit bone, to which Grandmaster identifies as Spirt Bone fusion. Tang San is about meet with Ning Feng Zhi, where Ao Sika (Oscar) and Ning Rongrong come face to face with eachother.","air_date":"2021-01-09","still":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jVwRpAdIzr6iOpN21Bq2EX0c9Wp.jpg","runtime":20},{"number":139.0,"title":"Episode 139","overview":null,"air_date":"2021-01-16","still":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xLD1GsALHy9z8IyUpfF6DBHcSWL.jpg","runtime":20},{"number":140.0,"title":"Episode 140","overview":null,"air_date":"2021-01-23","still":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5bRTzmbhtdF4a4Y80OMrpGECC3e.jpg","runtime":20},{"number":141.0,"title":"Episode 141","overview":null,"air_date":"2021-01-30","still":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aBLONAQd4yJlsIxcItlggIbp1Zi.jpg","runtime":20},{"number":142.0,"title":"Episode 142","overview":null,"air_date":"2021-02-06","still":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hakVYP4xVzldX2CFmaSnNw0tscO.jpg","runtime":20},{"number":143.0,"title":"Episode 143","overview":null,"air_date":"2021-02-13","still":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dZVsQpVdSnXP9sgsloUrD0tFTml.jpg","runtime":20},{"number":144.0,"title":"Episode 144","overview":null,"air_date":"2021-02-20","still":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oOUXq3RmYOkhfpoZ5Lbj9s7iTBz.jpg","runtime":20},{"number":145.0,"title":"Episode 145","overview":null,"air_date":"2021-02-27","still":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y3v53uQExU5qplF1fFf5o6prmDs.jpg","runtime":20},{"number":146.0,"title":"Episode 146","overview":null,"air_date":"2021-03-06","still":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/stHDfTCmxU93CdcO6v4Lcn1fYRT.jpg","runtime":20},{"number":147.0,"title":"Episode 147","overview":null,"air_date":"2021-03-13","still":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sfeGtj1NgAZpg9u4s9Q3iq43lnZ.jpg","runtime":20},{"number":148.0,"title":"Episode 148","overview":null,"air_date":"2021-03-20","still":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5ZfMPdCKasp3DftfCP75Xp9RddZ.jpg","runtime":20},{"number":149.0,"title":"Episode 149","overview":null,"air_date":"2021-03-27","still":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2MV5rhber5hOzhAlTqptKYGgRNn.jpg","runtime":20},{"number":150.0